{!-- with no check asked for (eg. no viewer to check for) the content shows; when the check fails with nothing to say instead, the root is `hidden`, so a list or carousel can skip it --}
<div hidden={not (@boundary_can or !@check_object_boundary) and not slot_assigned?(:if_not) and
  is_nil(@if_not_say)}>
  {#if @boundary_can or !@check_object_boundary}
    <#slot />
  {#else}
    <#slot {@if_not}>{@if_not_say}</#slot>
  {/if}
</div>
